---
// HowItWorksUK.astro - UK specific "How it works" emphasizing ongoing managed service
---

<section class="py-20 bg-bg-elevated relative section-fade-in">
  <!-- Gradient divider at top -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-accent-primary/50 to-transparent"></div>
  
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold font-heading text-text-primary mb-4">
        How it works
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-text-secondary">
        A fully managed service from start to finish — and beyond
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-12 max-w-5xl mx-auto icon-list">
      <div class="text-center group icon-list-item card-lift">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-gradient-primary text-white text-2xl font-bold font-heading mb-4 shadow-glow-soft group-hover:shadow-glow-primary transition-all">
          1
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-heading text-text-primary mb-3">Tell us about your business</h3>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
          Share your business, area, and goals. We'll review everything and explain exactly how we'd approach your site before anything goes live.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="text-center group icon-list-item card-lift">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-gradient-primary text-white text-2xl font-bold font-heading mb-4 shadow-glow-soft group-hover:shadow-glow-primary transition-all">
          2
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-heading text-text-primary mb-3">We build and refine together</h3>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
          We create your site and show you the draft. We go back and forth as needed, refining it until you're completely happy.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="text-center group icon-list-item card-lift">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-gradient-primary text-white text-2xl font-bold font-heading mb-4 shadow-glow-soft group-hover:shadow-glow-primary transition-all">
          3
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-heading text-text-primary mb-3">We launch and manage ongoing</h3>
        <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
          Once it's right, we launch. Then we host it, manage it, and handle any changes you need — all included in your monthly fee.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Key points -->
    <div class="mt-16 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <div class="glass rounded-xl p-6 border-accent-primary/20">
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-center">
          <div>
            <p class="text-accent-primary font-bold text-lg mb-1">Unlimited changes</p>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">No extra charge for updates</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-accent-primary font-bold text-lg mb-1">Hosting included</p>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">All handled by us</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-accent-primary font-bold text-lg mb-1">Ongoing relationship</p>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">We're with you long-term</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  
  <!-- Gradient divider at bottom -->
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-accent-secondary/50 to-transparent"></div>
</section>
